        "column_VKVBwq": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 4,
            "title": "I wish I could let you feel the difference this made in my body",
            "text": "<p>As a 35-year-old woman, I had been struggling with low energy and a lack of libido. After just three days of using Himalayan Pure Shialjit Gold Resin, I’m amazed by the results.</p>",
