        "column_nyKRE9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "I have so much energy now",
            "text": "<p>I was struggling to build muscle and felt stuck with slow gains and long recovery times. Since starting Turkesterone, everything’s changed—my muscle growth has accelerated, strength and endurance have improved, and recovery is much faster.</p>",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/alex.webp",
            "author": "<strong>Alex M.</strong>"
          }
        },
        "column_KnHfXN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "title": "Finally found my relief for menopause",
            "text": "<p>Menopause hit me hard—I gained 10 pounds in the first year and felt sluggish and out of sorts. Then I found Himalayan Pure Shialjit Gold Resin, and it’s been a game changer. After just a few weeks, I look and feel lighter, and my mental clarity is finally coming back. </p>",
            "author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/arwen.webp",
            "author": "<em><strong>Author</strong></em>"
          }
        }
      },
